# ── Secrets ──
# Microsoft Graph credentials for the SharePoint integration. This file holds a
# client secret and must never be committed. It lives outside the repo in
# production (C:\app\graph-config.json); this rule covers the case where someone
# drops a copy in the working tree while testing.
graph-config.json
*.secret
*.pfx
.env
.env.*

# ── Uploaded and scanned records ──
# Children's and staff records: proof of income, scanned monitoring evidence,
# anything ingested through the site. These are served only through auth-gated
# endpoints and must never reach the remote, so the whole store is ignored
# rather than relying on anyone remembering which paths are sensitive.
#
# Do NOT put scanned records in Internal/documents — that folder is tracked and
# already holds committed reference PDFs, so files dropped there get published.
uploads/
filestore/
Internal/documents/private/

# ── Scratch files ──
# Temporary output used when reading command results, and PDF text extraction.
_*.txt
_*.js
_*.sql
_q.sql

# ── OS / editor noise ──
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
